  </reporting-org>
  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Localisation of adaptation priorities including Nature-based Solutions (NbS) and strengthened climate and disaster risk finance in climate-vulnerable areas of Thailand</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Improved capacities and resulting integration of Nature-based Solutions (NbS) and Climate and Disaster Risk Finance and Insurance (CDRFI) into provincial and national agricultural planning and budgeting processes in Thailand lead to mainstreaming of adaptation priorities into plans and budgets and complementary use of international climate finance, and ultimately strengthened resilience for agriculture and food security, in line with National Adaptation Plan (NAP) priorities.</narrative>
  </description>
